+0.010      key tap end
+0.010      key tap pagedown
+0.010      key tap pgdn
+0.010      key tap up
+0.010      key tap left
+0.010      key tap down
+0.010      key tap right
+0.010      key tap kp0
+0.010      key tap kp1
